        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through The Pain</strong> is a chaotic low-poly adventure where you control a hyperactive spinning meme cat trying to survive one absurd world after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: <strong>cross the entire world without losing your mind</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/689ecccb2b42caece07098f36ef37c89.poster.avif?t=1764490251\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/689ecccb2b42caece07098f36ef37c89.webm?t=1764490251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/689ecccb2b42caece07098f36ef37c89.mp4?t=1764490251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, bounce, and spin through a series of wild themed zones — icy mountains, dusty deserts, western canyons, peaceful forests, and more. Each biome is packed with moving traps and ridiculous obstacles designed to make you laugh, rage, and immediately try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake can launch you back, flip you upside down, or send you spinning into trouble.<br>Every success pushes you deeper into chaos — and closer to the final stage:<br>a <strong>full-on disco party</strong> where the cat’s friends are waiting to celebrate your victory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/8212b787c5d62d3465683bb588818980.avif?t=1764490251\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras_big/8212b787c5d62d3465683bb588818980.webp?t=1764490251 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play as a spinning meme cat with physics that never behave<br>• One long continuous level filled with handcrafted traps and surprises<br>• Multiple themed biomes with unique challenges<br>• Chaotic “fail-and-try-again” fun inspired by rage platformers<br>• Fast resets, quick attempts, and constant “I swear this time I got it” moments<br>• A disco ending that feels earned after all the pain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One world. One spinning cat.<br>Countless attempts.<br>Pure chaotic fun.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through The Pain</strong> is a chaotic low-poly adventure where you control a hyperactive spinning meme cat trying to survive one absurd world after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: <strong>cross the entire world without losing your mind</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/689ecccb2b42caece07098f36ef37c89.poster.avif?t=1764490251\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/689ecccb2b42caece07098f36ef37c89.webm?t=1764490251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/689ecccb2b42caece07098f36ef37c89.mp4?t=1764490251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, bounce, and spin through a series of wild themed zones — icy mountains, dusty deserts, western canyons, peaceful forests, and more. Each biome is packed with moving traps and ridiculous obstacles designed to make you laugh, rage, and immediately try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake can launch you back, flip you upside down, or send you spinning into trouble.<br>Every success pushes you deeper into chaos — and closer to the final stage:<br>a <strong>full-on disco party</strong> where the cat’s friends are waiting to celebrate your victory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/8212b787c5d62d3465683bb588818980.avif?t=1764490251\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras_big/8212b787c5d62d3465683bb588818980.webp?t=1764490251 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play as a spinning meme cat with physics that never behave<br>• One long continuous level filled with handcrafted traps and surprises<br>• Multiple themed biomes with unique challenges<br>• Chaotic “fail-and-try-again” fun inspired by rage platformers<br>• Fast resets, quick attempts, and constant “I swear this time I got it” moments<br>• A disco ending that feels earned after all the pain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One world. One spinning cat.<br>Countless attempts.<br>Pure chaotic fun.</strong></p>",
